{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["空间解析几何", "平面方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$x-y+z=0$", "explanation": "第一条直线的方向向量为\n\n$$\n\\boldsymbol v_1=(0,1,1),\n$$\n\n第二条直线的方向向量为\n\n$$\n\\boldsymbol v_2=(1,2,1).\n$$\n\n所求平面与两直线都平行，因此平面内含有这两个方向。其法向量可取\n\n$$\n\\boldsymbol n=\\boldsymbol v_1\\times \\boldsymbol v_2=(-1,1,-1).\n$$\n\n又平面过原点，所以\n\n$$\n-x+y-z=0,\n$$\n\n即\n\n$$\nx-y+z=0.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["一元函数极值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$x=\\dfrac{1}{e}$", "explanation": "当 $x>0$ 时，\n\n$$\ny=x^{2x},\\qquad \\ln y=2x\\ln x.\n$$\n\n两边求导得\n\n$$\n\\frac{y'}{y}=2(\\ln x+1).\n$$\n\n令 $y'=0$，得\n\n$$\n\\ln x+1=0,\\qquad x=e^{-1}.\n$$\n\n当 $x<e^{-1}$ 时 $y'<0$，当 $x>e^{-1}$ 时 $y'>0$，故函数在\n\n$$\nx=\\frac{1}{e}\n$$\n\n处取得极小值。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分应用", "平面图形面积"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\dfrac{3}{2}$", "explanation": "曲线 $y=\\ln x$ 与 $y=0$ 交于 $x=1$；直线 $y=e+1-x$ 与 $y=0$ 交于 $x=e+1$；曲线与直线交于 $x=e$，此时 $y=1$。\n\n因此所围面积为\n\n$$\nS=\\int_1^e \\ln x\\,dx+\\int_e^{e+1}(e+1-x)\\,dx.\n$$\n\n计算得\n\n$$\n\\int_1^e \\ln x\\,dx=\\bigl(x\\ln x-x\\bigr)\\big|_1^e=1,\n$$\n\n且\n\n$$\n\\int_e^{e+1}(e+1-x)\\,dx=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\n故\n\n$$\nS=\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["第二型曲线积分", "格林公式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$-18\\pi$", "explanation": "记\n\n$$\nP=2xy-2y,\\qquad Q=x^2-4x.\n$$\n\n由格林公式，\n\n$$\n\\oint_L P\\,dx+Q\\,dy\n=\\iint_D\\left(\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}-\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}\\right)\\,dxdy,\n$$\n\n其中 $D:x^2+y^2\\le 9$。又\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}=2x-4,\\qquad\n\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}=2x-2,\n$$\n\n故\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}-\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}=-2.\n$$\n\n于是\n\n$$\n\\oint_L P\\,dx+Q\\,dy=-2\\cdot \\pi\\cdot 3^2=-18\\pi.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["向量在基下的坐标"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$(1,1,-1)$", "explanation": "设 $u=c_1\\alpha_1+c_2\\alpha_2+c_3\\alpha_3$。由\n\n$$\nc_1(1,1,0)+c_2(1,0,1)+c_3(0,1,1)=(2,0,0)\n$$\n\n得方程组\n\n$$\n\\begin{cases}\nc_1+c_2=2,\\\\\nc_1+c_3=0,\\\\\nc_2+c_3=0.\n\\end{cases}\n$$\n\n解得\n\n$$\nc_1=1,\\qquad c_2=1,\\qquad c_3=-1.\n$$\n\n故坐标为\n\n$$\n(1,1,-1).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "solution", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "定积分", "等价无穷小"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$a=4,\\ b=1$", "explanation": "当 $x\\to0$ 时，\n\n$$\n\\int_0^x\\frac{t^2}{\\sqrt{a+t^2}}\\,dt\n\\sim \\int_0^x\\frac{t^2}{\\sqrt{a}}\\,dt\n=\\frac{x^3}{3\\sqrt{a}}.\n$$\n\n又\n\n$$\nbx-\\sin x=(b-1)x+\\frac{x^3}{6}+o(x^3).\n$$\n\n要使极限为有限非零值，必须先有\n\n$$\nb=1.\n$$\n\n此时分母等价于 $x^3/6$，故\n\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\dfrac{x^3}{3\\sqrt{a}}}{\\dfrac{x^3}{6}}\n=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{a}}=1.\n$$\n\n因此\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{a}=2,\\qquad a=4.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "solution", "score": null, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["多元复合函数偏导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\bigl[f_1(x,xy)+y f_2(x,xy)\\bigr](1+y)g'(x+xy)$", "explanation": "设 $f_1,f_2$ 分别表示 $f$ 对第一、第二个变量的偏导数。由复合函数求导法则，\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial x}\n=f_1(x,xy)+y f_2(x,xy).\n$$\n\n又\n\n$$\nv=g(x+xy)=g\\bigl(x(1+y)\\bigr),\n$$\n\n故\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial v}{\\partial x}=(1+y)g'(x+xy).\n$$\n\n于是\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial x}\\cdot\\frac{\\partial v}{\\partial x}\n=\\bigl[f_1(x,xy)+y f_2(x,xy)\\bigr](1+y)g'(x+xy).\n$$", "methods": ["复合函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "solution", "score": null, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵方程", "逆矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$B=\\begin{pmatrix}5&-2&-2\\\\4&-3&-2\\\\-2&2&3\\end{pmatrix}$", "explanation": "由\n\n$$\nAB=A+2B\n$$\n\n得\n\n$$\n(A-2E)B=A.\n$$\n\n由于\n\n$$\nA-2E=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&0&1\\\\\n1&-1&0\\\\\n0&1&2\n\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n\n且 $|A-2E|\\ne0$，故\n\n$$\nB=(A-2E)^{-1}A.\n$$\n\n计算得\n\n$$\nB=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n5&-2&-2\\\\\n4&-3&-2\\\\\n-2&2&3\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "solution", "score": 8, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["常系数线性微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$y=C_0+e^{-3x}(C_1\\cos ax+C_2\\sin ax)+\\dfrac{x}{a^2+9}$", "explanation": "令 $u=y'$，原方程化为\n\n$$\nu''+6u'+(9+a^2)u=1.\n$$\n\n对应齐次方程的特征方程为\n\n$$\n\\lambda^2+6\\lambda+9+a^2=0,\n$$\n\n即\n\n$$\n(\\lambda+3)^2+a^2=0.\n$$\n\n故\n\n$$\nu_h=e^{-3x}(A\\cos ax+B\\sin ax).\n$$\n\n取常数特解\n\n$$\nu_p=\\frac{1}{9+a^2}.\n$$\n\n于是\n\n$$\ny'=e^{-3x}(A\\cos ax+B\\sin ax)+\\frac{1}{9+a^2}.\n$$\n\n积分后仍可把指数三角项的常数重新记为 $C_1,C_2$，得通解\n\n$$\ny=C_0+e^{-3x}(C_1\\cos ax+C_2\\sin ax)+\\frac{x}{a^2+9}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["级数敛散性", "交错级数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": [], "answer": "C", "explanation": "原级数可写为\n\n$$\n\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}(-1)^n\\left(\\frac{1}{n}+\\frac{k}{n^2}\\right).\n$$\n\n其中 $\\sum (-1)^n/n$ 收敛但不绝对收敛，$\\sum (-1)^n k/n^2$ 绝对收敛，所以原级数收敛。\n\n但\n\n$$\n\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\left|\\frac{k+n}{n^2}\\right|\n\\sim \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{n}\n$$\n\n发散，因此原级数为条件收敛。选 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "连续性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": [], "answer": "D", "explanation": "令 $u=tx$，则 $du=t\\,dx$。于是\n\n$$\nI=t\\int_0^{s/t}f(tx)\\,dx\n=t\\int_0^s f(u)\\frac{du}{t}\n=\\int_0^s f(u)\\,du.\n$$\n\n因此 $I$ 只依赖于 $s$，不依赖于 $t$。选 D。", "methods": ["换元积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["导数定义", "极值判定"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": [], "answer": "B", "explanation": "由题设\n\n$$\n\\frac{f(x)-f(a)}{(x-a)^2}\\to -1\n$$\n\n可知，当 $x$ 充分接近 $a$ 且 $x\\ne a$ 时，\n\n$$\nf(x)-f(a)<0.\n$$\n\n因此 $f(a)$ 是局部最大值。并且\n\n$$\n\\frac{f(x)-f(a)}{x-a}\n=\\frac{f(x)-f(a)}{(x-a)^2}(x-a)\\to0,\n$$\n\n所以 $f'(a)=0$。选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["伴随矩阵", "行列式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": [], "answer": "C", "explanation": "当 $|A|=a\\ne0$ 时，\n\n$$\nA^*=|A|A^{-1}.\n$$\n\n两边取行列式得\n\n$$\n|A^*|=||A|A^{-1}|=|A|^n|A^{-1}|\n=a^n\\cdot \\frac{1}{a}=a^{n-1}.\n$$\n\n选 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["幂级数", "和函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": [], "answer": "收敛域为 $[-2,2)$；和函数 $S(x)=-\\dfrac{1}{x}\\ln\\left(1-\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)$（$x\\ne0$），且 $S(0)=\\dfrac{1}{2}$", "explanation": "原级数为\n\n$$\nS(x)=\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^{n-1}}{n2^n}.\n$$\n\n令 $u=x/2$，则\n\n$$\nS(x)=\\frac{1}{x}\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^n}{n2^n}\n=\\frac{1}{x}\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{u^n}{n}.\n$$\n\n当 $|u|<1$，即 $|x|<2$ 时，\n\n$$\n\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{u^n}{n}=-\\ln(1-u),\n$$\n\n故\n\n$$\nS(x)=-\\frac{1}{x}\\ln\\left(1-\\frac{x}{2}\\right)\\quad (x\\ne0).\n$$\n\n当 $x=0$ 时，原级数只剩首项的极限形式，或由上式取极限，得\n\n$$\nS(0)=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\n端点处，$x=2$ 时级数为 $\\sum 1/(2n)$ 发散；$x=-2$ 时为 $\\sum (-1)^{n-1}/(2n)$ 收敛。故收敛域为\n\n$$\n[-2,2).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["第二型曲面积分", "高斯公式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$34\\pi$", "explanation": "旋转曲面满足\n\n$$\ny=1+x^2+z^2,\\qquad x^2+z^2\\le2.\n$$\n\n按题意，法向量与 $y$ 轴正向夹角大于 $\\pi/2$，故取参数化\n\n$$\n\\boldsymbol r(x,z)=(x,1+x^2+z^2,z),\n$$\n\n并取有向面积向量\n\n$$\n\\boldsymbol r_z\\times\\boldsymbol r_x=(2x,-1,2z).\n$$\n\n记\n\n$$\nP=x(8y+1),\\quad Q=2(1-y^2),\\quad R=-4yz.\n$$\n\n则\n\n$$\nI=\\iint_D\\bigl(2xP-Q+2zR\\bigr)\\,dxdz,\n$$\n\n其中 $D:x^2+z^2\\le2$，$y=1+x^2+z^2$。令 $x=r\\cos\\theta,z=r\\sin\\theta$，则角向积分后被积函数化为\n\n$$\n\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\bigl(2xP-Q+2zR\\bigr)\\,d\\theta\n=\\pi(18r^2+12r^4).\n$$\n\n因此\n\n$$\nI=\\pi\\int_0^{\\sqrt{2}}(18r^3+12r^5)\\,dr\n=\\pi\\left(\\frac{9}{2}r^4+2r^6\\right)\\Big|_0^{\\sqrt{2}}\n=34\\pi.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["介值定理", "唯一性证明"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": [], "answer": "见解析", "explanation": "令\n\n$$\ng(x)=f(x)-x.\n$$\n\n由于 $f(x)$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上取值恒在 $(0,1)$ 内，所以\n\n$$\ng(0)=f(0)>0,\\qquad g(1)=f(1)-1<0.\n$$\n\n由连续函数介值定理，存在 $\\xi\\in(0,1)$，使\n\n$$\ng(\\xi)=0,\n$$\n\n即\n\n$$\nf(\\xi)=\\xi.\n$$\n\n再证唯一性。若存在 $0<x_1<x_2<1$，使\n\n$$\nf(x_1)=x_1,\\qquad f(x_2)=x_2,\n$$\n\n则\n\n$$\ng(x_1)=g(x_2)=0.\n$$\n\n由罗尔定理，存在 $\\eta\\in(x_1,x_2)$，使\n\n$$\ng'(\\eta)=0.\n$$\n\n但\n\n$$\ng'(x)=f'(x)-1,\n$$\n\n于是 $g'(\\eta)=0$ 意味着 $f'(\\eta)=1$，与题设 $f'(x)\\ne1$ 矛盾。因此这样的点唯一。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 8, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["线性方程组解的判定", "通解"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$a\\ne1$ 时有唯一解；$a=1,b\\ne-1$ 时无解；$a=1,b=-1$ 时有无穷多解，通解为 $(-1+s+t,\\ 1-2s-2t,\\ s,\\ t)$", "explanation": "对增广矩阵作初等行变换。先用第 4 行减去第 1 行的 3 倍，系数矩阵的行列式等于\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}\n1&2&2\\\\\n-1&a-3&-2\\\\\n-1&-2&a-3\n\\end{vmatrix}\n=(a-1)^2.\n$$\n\n因此当 $a\\ne1$ 时，系数矩阵可逆，方程组有唯一解。\n\n当 $a=1$ 时，后 3 个方程的系数部分满足\n\n$$\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&2&2\\\\\n-1&-2&-2\\\\\n-1&-2&-2\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n\n此时第二个方程给出\n\n$$\nx_2+2x_3+2x_4=1.\n$$\n\n第三个方程左端为其相反数，故相容要求\n\n$$\nb=-1.\n$$\n\n第四个方程也给出相同条件。于是：\n\n$$\na=1,\\ b\\ne-1\n$$\n\n时无解；\n\n$$\na=1,\\ b=-1\n$$\n\n时有无穷多解。令 $x_3=s,\\ x_4=t$，由\n\n$$\nx_2+2x_3+2x_4=1\n$$\n\n得\n\n$$\nx_2=1-2s-2t.\n$$\n\n再由\n\n$$\nx_1+x_2+x_3+x_4=0\n$$\n\n得\n\n$$\nx_1=-1+s+t.\n$$\n\n故通解为\n\n$$\n(x_1,x_2,x_3,x_4)=(-1+s+t,\\ 1-2s-2t,\\ s,\\ t),\n\\quad s,t\\in\\mathbb R.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 2, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["独立重复试验", "二项分布"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$1-(1-p)^n$；$(1-p)^n+np(1-p)^{n-1}$", "explanation": "$n$ 次独立试验中，事件 $A$ 一次也不发生的概率为 $(1-p)^n$。因此至少发生一次的概率为\n\n$$\n1-(1-p)^n.\n$$\n\n至多发生一次包括发生 $0$ 次和发生 $1$ 次两种情形，所以概率为\n\n$$\n(1-p)^n+\\binom n1p(1-p)^{n-1}\n=(1-p)^n+np(1-p)^{n-1}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 2, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["全概率公式", "贝叶斯公式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\dfrac{53}{120}$；$\\dfrac{20}{53}$", "explanation": "设 $W$ 表示取出白球。由全概率公式，\n\n$$\nP(W)=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{3}{6}+\\frac{5}{8}\\right)\n=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{5}{8}\\right)\n=\\frac{53}{120}.\n$$\n\n由贝叶斯公式，已知取出白球时它来自第二个箱子的概率为\n\n$$\nP(B_2\\mid W)\n=\\frac{P(B_2)P(W\\mid B_2)}{P(W)}\n=\\frac{\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}}{\\frac{53}{120}}\n=\\frac{20}{53}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 2, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["连续型随机变量", "正态分布"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$E(X)=1$；$D(X)=\\dfrac{1}{2}$", "explanation": "密度函数可写为\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt\\pi}e^{-(x-1)^2}.\n$$\n\n与正态分布密度\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\sigma}\\exp\\left[-\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\right]\n$$\n\n比较，得\n\n$$\n\\mu=1,\\qquad 2\\sigma^2=1.\n$$\n\n故\n\n$$\nE(X)=1,\\qquad D(X)=\\sigma^2=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_1987", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 1987, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "solution", "score": 6, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["随机变量函数分布", "卷积"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$f_Z(z)=\\begin{cases}0,&z\\le0,\\\\\\dfrac{1}{2}(1-e^{-z}),&0<z\\le2,\\\\\\dfrac{1}{2}(e^2-1)e^{-z},&z>2.\\end{cases}$", "explanation": "令\n\n$$\nW=2X.\n$$\n\n由于 $X\\sim U(0,1)$，故\n\n$$\nf_W(w)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\dfrac{1}{2},&0\\le w\\le2,\\\\\n0,&\\text{其他}.\n\\end{cases}\n$$\n\n又 $Z=W+Y$，且 $W,Y$ 独立，所以由卷积公式\n\n$$\nf_Z(z)=\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} f_W(w)f_Y(z-w)\\,dw.\n$$\n\n只有当 $0\\le w\\le2$ 且 $z-w>0$ 时 integrand 非零。因此：\n\n当 $z\\le0$ 时，\n\n$$\nf_Z(z)=0.\n$$\n\n当 $0<z\\le2$ 时，\n\n$$\nf_Z(z)=\\int_0^z \\frac{1}{2} e^{-(z-w)}\\,dw\n=\\frac{1}{2}(1-e^{-z}).\n$$\n\n当 $z>2$ 时，\n\n$$\nf_Z(z)=\\int_0^2 \\frac{1}{2} e^{-(z-w)}\\,dw\n=\\frac{1}{2}(e^2-1)e^{-z}.\n$$\n\n综上，\n\n$$\nf_Z(z)=\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&z\\le0,\\\\\n\\dfrac{1}{2}(1-e^{-z}),&0<z\\le2,\\\\\n\\dfrac{1}{2}(e^2-1)e^{-z},&z>2.\n\\end{cases}\n$$", "methods": []}
